-- Currency — ISO 4217 currency with symbol and decimal precision.
--
-- Reference rows live in currency-data.fenel as per-row value-decls
-- (`currency_USD = Currency {…}`), indexed under `Currency` by the value-
-- registry loader and registered as global-scope by-type dispatch targets
-- (storage-as-effect Phase 3a — the retired setStaticData map + currencies.ts
-- array). Identity and field facets are registered from Fenel directives.
--
-- Phase 3a pilot for the system-entities sweep — see
-- workstreams/ts-elimination/briefs/phase-3a-currency-pilot.md. Field
-- labels (Code / Name / Symbol / Decimals) use the UUID field facet fallback
-- to a humanized current Codeable, so the .fenel source carries the structural
-- shape only.

@entity
@codeName "currency"
@label "Currency"
@description "ISO 4217 currency with symbol and decimal precision"
@icon "dollar-sign"
Currency = Currency code: String name: String symbol: String decimals: Number
